  "name": "AgentX Security SDK",
  "description": "Keyless firewall for any MCP server. Wrap the server's command in one line of mcp.json (`agentx-mcp <server command>`) and it blocks catastrophic tool calls (destructive SQL, SSRF, secret/PII reads, rm -rf, path traversal) before they reach the server, keeping the agent's run alive instead of dying on the block. No API key, nothing leaves your machine. Install: `pip install agentx-security-sdk`.",
